{"turn_id": "d13-t1", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "pair_of_languages", "text": "该方法将 CoNLL 2009 shared task 中一对语言的资源结合起来，构建 polyglot 语义角色标注器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "针对 CoNLL 2009 数据集中的每种语言训练若干 parser：一个传统的单语版本，以及额外融入该数据集英文部分监督信息的变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "multilingual_vectors_plus_data", "text": "polyglot 训练使用多语言词向量，并跨语言合并训练数据，无需跨语言对齐、共享标注或平行数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "conll2009_seven_languages", "text": "系统在 CoNLL-2009 shared task 的语义角色标注部分上对全部七种语言进行评估：Catalan、Chinese、Czech、English、German、Japanese 和 Spanish。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d13-t2", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "resource_combination", "text": "该方法将 CoNLL 2009 shared task 中一对语言的资源结合起来，构建 polyglot 语义角色标注器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "对于每种语言，论文训练传统单语解析器，以及额外引入数据集中英语部分监督信息的变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "pretrained_multilingual_embeddings", "text": "第一个 polyglot 变体通过使用预训练多语言嵌入，在各语言与英语之间进行多语言共享。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-9b03e56e9d4e26ccec14a017"}]}, {"key": "union_of_annotations", "text": "该 polyglot 模型在两语言标注的并集上训练，并用分层采样使两个数据集在训练中获得相等的有效权重，且确保每个训练实例每个 epoch 至少被看到一次。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-9b03e56e9d4e26ccec14a017"}]}, {"key": "embedding_construction", "text": "多语言嵌入由单语嵌入生成，使用 ammar2016massively 的方法：对每个非英语语言，使用小规模跨语言词典和典型相关分析，求得将非英语向量变换到英语向量空间的变换。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-9b03e56e9d4e26ccec14a017"}]}, {"key": "separate_label_representations", "text": "由于论元标签集在语言对之间不相交且对应关系不明确，论文为每种语言的标签使用单独的标签表示。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-9b03e56e9d4e26ccec14a017"}]}, {"key": "language_specific_predicate_senses", "text": "由于不同语言的谓词词义（如 look.01 与 mira.01）可能并不对应，谓词词义表示也是语言特定的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-9b03e56e9d4e26ccec14a017"}]}, {"key": "no_parallel_or_alignment", "text": "该方法使用多语言词向量并跨语言合并训练数据，从而无需跨语言对齐、共享标注或平行数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "data_languages", "text": "所用数据为 CoNLL-2009 shared task 的语义角色标注部分，覆盖全部七种语言：加泰罗尼亚语、汉语、捷克语、英语、德语、日语和西班牙语。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
